# Keep large source assets OUT of the Vercel deployment.
#
# Without this file the CLI uploads the whole working dir, and Next's file
# tracer sweeps these into the api/parents/story/file lambda (it reads from
# process.cwd()), pushing it past the 300MB function-size limit.
#
# Runtime-needed PDFs live in public/parents-docs/ and private-docs/ and are
# NOT matched here (the *.pdf rule below is root-anchored). Seminar videos and
# decks are served from Supabase Storage, so they never belong in the bundle.

# Media / presentation source files (never needed at runtime)
*.mp4
*.key
*.docx

# Root-level source PDFs and decks (e.g. seminar-deck.pdf, AP_*_ultimate*.pdf).
# Leading slash anchors to the repo root so public/ and private-docs/ PDFs stay.
/*.pdf
AP_Biology_ultimate*

# Textbook source-PDF folders — content already seeded to Supabase Storage
AP_*_PDFs_*/

# Build/seed tooling — never imported at runtime. The question-bank-seed JSON
# corpus (~330MB, 4400+ files) and textbook build artifacts (~57MB) were being
# traced into the api/parents/story/file lambda (process.cwd() read), blowing
# past the 250MB function-size limit. Exclude these heavy dirs — but NOT all of
# scripts/, because postinstall runs scripts/copy-pdfjs-assets.mjs.
scripts/question-bank-seed/
scripts/textbook/

# Stray screenshots / image exports at the repo root
/*.png

# Admit-sample source folder
합격/
